perates in Japan, South Korea, Singapore, Taiwan, China, rest of Asia, the Netherlands, rest of Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and the United States. The company was formerly known as ASM Lithography Holding N.V. and changed its name to ASML Holding N.V. in 2001. ASML Holding N.V. was founded in 1984 and is headquartered in Veldhoven, the Netherlands.","fullTimeEmployees":44681,"city":"Veldhoven","country":"Netherlands","website":"https://www.asml.com","industry":"Semiconductor Equipment & Materials","sector":"Technology"},"news":[],"info_date":"2026-10-24"}